<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Locked</Major>
    <Description>The macro for the game «Locked» in Roblox performs a 180-degree rotation, quickly switches to a formless state and returns to its original direction, looking in the same direction as before. The camera movement is slightly randomized to make it more legit, and it is also slowed to add to it. It is recommended to use a sensitivity of 0.171 at a resolution of 800 DPI in Roblox. The 1920 x 1080 resolution is considered optimal, but you can choose any other one, since the mouse movement depends on the relative coordinates. The turning is slowed so that you don't seem obvious when you clip it, but there are no promises.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
